+
+The two inspected sources support the construction and identities; the local proof includes the cellular argument for the required Thom class rather than treating a citation as the proof. This lemma depends transitively on the missing batch-8 Borel definition and therefore cannot receive ready status until that carrier is current.
+
+## Remaining authoring and checks
